From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 00:16:04 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 098/102] drm/panel: Add Novatek NT36672C panel driver

Add a driver for the 6.7" 1080x2520 Tianma NT36672C panel of the
Motorola moto g 5G plus: video mode over four lanes with DSC 1.1 (8 bpc,
8 bpp, two 540x20 slices per line). The init sequence, timings and DSC
parameters are from the downstream device tree; as downstream, the PPS
is sent after the on sequence and DSC is enabled with c0 03.

The bootloader leaves the panel running. Keep it on the first prepare
instead of resetting it, which on this touch and display chip also
resets the touch controller.

These changes were written with the help of an LLM and checked by a human.

